  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tito Rocha",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:17:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:17:42-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. Last Thursday I was getting my firewood stacked, and then the storm came Friday into Saturday, and Sunday I noticed a smell of smoke from the neighbor's chimney, not bad, but I wanted to ask the fire department a question. Is this the fire department?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:17:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No sir, this is the City Clerk's office at City Hall. Are you trying to reach the fire department's non-emergency line?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:18:03-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the non-emergency. I'm on my landline, the cord is the long curly one, it goes all the way across the kitchen. I dialed the number off my old list. Maybe the area code is wrong? I always forget if I need the four oh one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:18:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Four oh one is right for Newport, so that's not the problem. I think the number on your list just isn't the right one. Let me look up the fire department's non-emergency number for you. Do you have a pen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:18:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do, it's by the toaster. Go ahead, I'll stretch the cord."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T09:18:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, take your time. I'll give it to you slowly, and then I'll read it back."
    }
  ],
